# `sumif` adds the values of the rows where the predicate is true.
mode: run
---- query
from '../../../data/orders.csv'
| summarize big = sumif(amount, amount >= 250), cnt = sumif(1, amount >= 250), t = sumif(1h, amount >= 250)
---- expected
big    | cnt  | t
real   | long | timespan
-------+------+---------
251.75 |    1 | 01:00:00
